  "contract": "Incendiary Shot 524870 reads '... causing your next 3 direct damage Advantage spenders to deal $524869s1% of their damage to nearby enemies.' Its effect 1 triggers Incendiary Arrows 524869 on the Ranger: a 15 sec (DurationIndex 8) aura whose tooltip is 'Your next 3 direct damage Advantage spenders trigger an Incendiary Explosion.', with one effect, aura 354 (BasePoints 49 = 50%) naming 570182, and ProcCharges 0. The core has no handler for aura 354, so the buff did nothing. 570182 'Incendiary Explosion' is Fire SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE on TARGET_UNIT_DEST_AREA_ENEMY (8 yd, up to 5 targets) that ignores caster and taken modifiers and cannot crit. Advantage spenders are the family-27 abilities with CasterAuraSpell 804329 (Advantage); Skullpiercer 802036 is one and deals direct damage. Expected: Incendiary Arrows arrives with 3 charges and Incendiary Shot's own hit does not spend one; each Skullpiercer that lands then detonates 570182 at its target, hitting a second enemy 2 yd behind it for 50% of the Skullpiercer's damage (window 0.45-0.58: rounding, and room for the ~1.11 damage multiplier some fixtures carry, while excluding a full-damage copy), and spends a charge; after the third the buff is gone and a fourth Skullpiercer detonates nothing. Before the fix the buff carries no charges and no 570182 damage ever occurs.",
